  "This building has an EDGE certificate. Here's how to read what it actually says.",
  "An EDGE certificate shows three savings, compared with a typical local building: energy, water, and the embodied energy in materials.",
  "To be certified, each of the three has to be at least 20 percent better.",
  "EDGE Advanced goes further, with at least 40 percent energy savings.",
  "And EDGE Zero Carbon adds renewable energy to cover the rest. Check the current protocol for the exact rules.",
  "So read the three numbers, not just the badge. Fifty percent energy and twenty percent water is a very different building from the reverse.",
